OL,3,GNEWSATeenage girl stabbed multiple
OL,4,Atimes by 14-year-old boy, murder trial
OL,5,Atold
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This article contains details
OL,8,Freaders may find distressing
OL,10,FA teenage girl was stabbed "around 55
OL,11,Ftimes" by a 14-year-old boy, a murder
OL,12,Ftrial has been told.
OL,14,FLilly Jones, from Blaina, in Blaenau
OL,15,FGwent, was stabbed in the heart and
OL,16,Fboth lungs as well as an artery in her
OL,17,Fneck. There were 17 stab wounds to her
OL,18,Fneck, and knife wounds were found on
OL,19,Fher face, jaw, chest and bottom.
